I smiled widely, gripping the fabric of the jersey. There was something exhilarating about this
—knowing that every hard hit, every goal, every flex of his muscles out there was for me. It was possessive and wild and completely Liam.

Chloe and I were loving it - dancing along to the music, jumping up and cheering at every goal. The energy was contagious.

