Maddie had abandoned her half-finished TikTok dance, now sprawled across the floor, tossing a stress ball up and down while Ava was stretched out on the couch, scrolling through her phone. Ben, for his part, had leaned back in the armchair, looking entirely too smug for someone whose music tastes had just been publicly eviscerated.

